**Cora.** A stage magician turned paranormal detective, hunting the
spirit that killed her father. Cora grew up torn between her American
father's stage magic and her Japanese mother's line of Shinto
priestesses, always trusting the former over the latter -- until she
alone witnessed a malevolent spirit cause her father's death during a
performance. Devastated and forced to reckon with truths she'd always
dismissed, she returned to her mother to learn the family's real
power, and now runs a paranormal detective agency, hoping one day to
find the entity responsible. Guarded and sharp-tongued, Cora treats
her true feelings the way she treats her tricks -- always hidden
behind whatever face she wants the world to see, making her almost
impossible to really know. *Attack (Card Shark) +2, Combat Expert +2,
Dexterous +2, Illusionist +2, Intuitive +1, Knowledge (Stage Magic)
+2, Magic, Witchcraft +2, Perceptive +1, Performer +2, Quick +1, Sixth
Sense +2, Spirit Medium +1, Vigorous +1; Dependency (Cigarettes) -1,
Focus (Attack and Witchcraft Require Cards) -2, Guardian (Chiyoko) -1,
Loner -2, Obsession (Find Father's Killer) -2, Overconfident -1, Quirk
(Playing with Cards) -1, Rude -1, Sensitivity (Inquiries to Personal
Life) -2, Stubborn -2.* Spade (Defensive, Ranged; Feather Blow): Roll
4, DX 3, End 0. Cora fans out a hand of cards, which can deflect
attacks and be thrown as a unit. Diamond (Armor Piercing x2, Ranged;
Ineffective): Roll 4, DX 2, End 5. Cora throws a card with dazzling
precision slicing through anything like butter. Heart (Paralyzing x2;
Finisher): Roll 4, DX 3, End 10. Cora places a card against the chest
of a battered foe, which explodes into a series of spiritual, binding
chains. Club (Area Effect, Stunning, Trap; Activation): Roll 4, DX 3,
End 15. Once placed, nothing can stop this blast. Defense 3. Health
40, Endurance 50. TV 12.

